During the development of this modpack, a substantial amount of internet memes, online cultural elements, and publicly circulated creative materials was incorporated.

These elements are primarily used to enrich the modpack experience, enhance its expressive effect, and reflect the creator's personal creative ideas.

The inclusion of such content does not indicate that the author owns the copyright to the original works, nor does it indicate any intention to offend, insult, or target any individual, group, work, or culture.

If any such content causes discomfort, suggestions may be submitted to the author through the available feedback channels.

